{
  "id": "MAT.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Yesu aho wafuma ū mu kaya akaja ūūkigasha kū ng'walo gwa nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbūka ntaale ya banhu yong'okaklūla kūshisha nose wingīla mu lyato wigasha, a mabita ga banhū gīmīīla ha ng'walo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandya kūbalomeela mihayo mingī mu shigemeng'hejo; ūhaya gīkī, “Mībi akafuma, ūja kūbība mbīyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alībība, jingī jūgwīla mu nzīla; jiza noni jūjilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu sī ya mawe mawe, jūgehelwa ī sī ya kūjifukīīla; ahene jikangūha ū kūzwa īkī jalī jitafukīīlilwe chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho lyaseba ī līīmi, lyūjoocha jūjiga, nguno jalī jitī na miji ya kwigela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu ming'hwa, aho jilīkūla na a ming'hwa gūkūlanīja najo, gūjishiteleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo jingī jikagwīla mu sī yawiza jūtwaja matwajo, jimò igana, jingī makūmi atandatū, na jingī makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na matū ni igwage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bahemba bakwe biza būmūja gīkī, “Nibūlī ūkūtūmamīlaga shigemeng'hejo dūhū ūlū ūkūbalangaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūhaya, “A bing'we ng'winhilwe būmani, mujimane ī mbisīla ja būtemi bo ng'wigūlū; alīyo a boi batinhilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo alī na shikolo, akongejiwa na shingī; alīyo ūyo atī na shikolo akataajiwa nī shisho alī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūtūmamīlaga shigemeng'hejo ūlū nalībalanga, nguno,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo a bing'we mulī na lubango īkī a miso ging'we gakūbonaga, na a matū ging'we gakwigwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, bahangi na batūngīlīja bingī baalī batogilwe kwībona īyo mukwībonaga alīyo batībonile; na kwīyigwa īyo mukwīyigwaga alīyo batīyigwile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna lūūlū, degelekagi a makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha mībi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū ūlū ūgwigwa ū mhayo gwa būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu alīyo ūleka ū kūgwitegeleja, akizaga ū Mi ogūpula ū mu ng'holò yakwe ūmo gūkahambagwa; ū ng'wenūyo alī gīt'ūmo jilī ī mbīyū ījo jikagwīla mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mbīyū ījo jikagwīla mu sī ya masegeng'he, ū ng'wene al'ūyo akagwigwaga ū mhayo wagwanukūla wangū wangū na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike gwikala gūtī na miji ū mulī we. Gūkangunanhaga ikanza iguhī dūhū, alīyo ūlū gilonga makoye nūūlū būluhi kūlwa nguno yago ū mhayo, haho na haho akagwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ī mbīyū ījo jikagwīla mu ming'hwa, ū ng'wene alī ūyo akagwigwaga ū mhayo, gwike gwashitelejiwa na myatīla ya būlī lūshikū, na būlemba lembi bo sabo; gwagaiwa a matwajo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mbīyū ījo jikagwīla mu sī yawiza, ū ng'wene h'ūyo akagwigwaga ū mhayo wagwitegeleja, watwaja matwajo, hamo igana, ūngī makūmi atandatū, ūngī makūmi adatū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha pūngū mu būsīga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla shigemeng'hejo hangī alīhaya gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū būshikile kwikolanījiwa na munhū ūyo akabība mbīyū jawiza mu ngūnda gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho balaalile a banhū, wiza ng'wanishi wakwe ūtūlagūlīla mo mbīyū ja pūngū, hūna wīnga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jahayūzwa na kwandya kūtwaja, jūbi mo na pūngū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biza a batūmami bakwe būng'wīla gīkī, ‘Baba ūtabībile mbīyū jawiza ū mu ngūnda gwako? Hama jafumaga halī hangī ī pūngū?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha alībawīla gīkī, ‘Ng'wanishi wagūbeegije ū gwenūyo.’ A batūmami būmūja, ‘Hamo ūlītogwa tūkajidubbagūle ī pūngū?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbashokeja alīhaya, ‘Yaya mutizūbūhūbīla nū būsīga bone. Nguno ū ng'wikanza lya kūjidubbūla ī pūngū, mudūgije kūhūbīla ng'ūbūdubbūla nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jilekagi jikūlanīje dūhū, līkūshika ī likanza lya kūgesa; ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo hū nakūbawīla a bagesi gīkī, Jikumingagi tame ī pūngū mujitunge maganda maganda mujipembe mu moto. Ū būsīga būgolanyagi chiza mubūtūūle ng'wiluuli lyane.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo shibīlī sha būtemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūbinha shigemeng'hejo shingī alīhaya gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū būbange gītī kabīyū ka haladali, ako munhū akakasola ūūkakahamba ng'wilaale lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A koyi kalī kado ka bado ū mu mbīyū pyī ī jose, alīyo ūlū kūūzwa na kūkūla, līkabizaga Isaka itaale kūtinda pye ī mitī ya masaka. Gūkabizaga ntī ntaale no, na noni ja kūlala jikapandīkaga wikalo ū mu matambī galyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūbawīla shigemeng'hejo shingī alīhaya gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū wikolile na shibimbya, īsho nkīma akasola ūgūlanya mu ngele idatū ja būsu, shūbūdudumya pyī ū bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yose yenīyī ū Yesu wabasomboolelaga a banhū mu shigemeng'hejo; atabasomboolelile mhayo nūūlū gūmò, ūlū ītī mu nzīla ya shigemeng'hejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko gūshikīlījiwa ūyo gūhayiwe kūbītīla mulī ng'hangi gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha pūngū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbalaga a banhū, ū wei ūshoka kaya, wiza wingīla mu numba. A bahemba bakwe būnsanga mo; būng'wīla, “Tūwīlage a makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha pūngū mu ngūnda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha alīhaya gīkī, “Ū mībi wa mbīyū jawiza alī Ng'wana wa Munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngūnda gwene sī, ī mbīyū ī jawiza bene baana ba mu būtemi, ī pūngū jene baana ba Ng'wanishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wanishi, ū ng'hambi wa pūngū ng'wene Shetani. A magesa būlī būkalīkījo w'ikanza, a bagesi bamalaika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ūmo pūngū jikakumingīlagwa japemva mu moto, h'ūmo īkūbizīla nū kū būkalīkījo w'ikanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ng'wana wa Munhū, akūbatūma a bamalaika bakwe hose hose ū mu būtemi bokwe, baje balīkuminga būlī shikolo īsho shikenhelejaga kwipama; pye na a bagomi a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bakūbaponya ng'wichongo lya moto, ūmo kūkūbiza kūlīla na kūshelanya mino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a batūngīlīja, bakūbiza ba kūng'weka ng'weka gītī līīmi ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Saabo. Ūyo alī na matū ni igwage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo shidatū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū būbizile gītī sabo, īyo yalī yifumbīkile ng'wilaale līmò, wahayībona munhū nebe ongeja ū kwībisa. Hūna kūlwa būyegi bokwe, ūja ūūkajinja pyī ī shikolo īsho walī nasho, ūūkalīgūla ī lilaale lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū būbizile gītī nsūlūja, nchooji wa mawe ga mpango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabona iwe lya mpango ntaale, ūja ūūkajinja pyī īsho walī nasho, ūlīgūla ī liwe lyenīlo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya na gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū būbange gītī igokoolo, īlo līkaponejiagwa mu nyanza lyagobanīja shikolo sha būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyakūhayūdutwa, ūlū lyashishiwa a ha ng'walo, bakigashaga kūsolanhya. Ī shawiza batūūla mu shiseme, lelo a ga būbi bagaponanja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īkūbizīla nū kū būkalīkījo w'ikanza; a bamalaika bakūja balībasolanhya a babūbi kūbīnja ū mu batūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbaponya ng'wichongo lya moto, ūmo kūkūbiza kūlīla na kūshelanya mino!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Yesu ūbabūja, “Ahene mulīyitegeleja pyī ī yenīyī?” Nabo būshosha, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla hangī gīkī, “Hūna lūūlū, būlī ng'wene ūyo alangilwe mihayo ya būtemi bo ng'wigūlū, abizile gītī namugī ha ng'wakwe, ūyo akafunyaga shikolo shipya na shikūlūkūlū, kwīngīīla mu wibīkīja bokwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūleng'wa mu nzengo go ng'wawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho washikalīcha ī shigemeng'hejo shenīsho, wīnga a henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūshika ū mu nzengo go ng'wawe wingīla ng'wisinagogi lyabo, wandya kūbalanga. Būyūkumya baliwīla gīkī, “Bing'we ū ng'wenūyū wafunije halī pye a masala genaya, nū būdūla wenūbū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūhaya hū ng'wene ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa selemala, nīyo nū nina akitanagwa Malia? Angū na a bazunaye ba Yakobo na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atī hū ng'wene ūyo na balūmbūye tūkwikalaga nabo ng'wenūmu ūmu? Hama ū wei wīfunije halī pyī ī yenīyī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūbatabanya ī mihayo yakwe, bipama! Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū ng'hangi atadalahagwa hose hose, ūlū ītī mu nzengo go ng'wawe na mu kaya ya ng'wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
